   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Putting the important thing first",
     "texto": [
      "To emphasise something, put it at the start of the sentence. The conjugated verb stays in second place: **Den bog har jeg læst.** = That book, I've read it.",
      "The usual order would be: **Jeg har læst den bog.**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "If you start with something else",
     "texto": [
      "When the sentence starts with another element (a place, a time, an object), the subject goes after the verb: **Hver dag går hun en tur.** = Every day she goes for a walk.",
      "It's the same rule as always: the verb always in second place."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
